{
  "rationale": "Use a small plant split into sensing and motion capability, then encode the exploration policy in specifications. The policy prioritizes forward progress in clear space, uses directed one-shot turns for side obstacles, uses a brief backward escape only for front-obstacle recovery, keeps action states robust to non-critical path_clear self-loops, and returns to forward exploration immediately when safe.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate uncontrollable perception from controllable motion capability with two plant automata",
    "Use one policy specification to map sensed conditions to exactly one safe action state and a second specification to force immediate return to forward exploration after recovery when path_clear appears"
  ],
